{
  "id": "DEU.13",
  "number": "13",
  "bookId": "DEU",
  "reference": "Ng'Atutik 13",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "13",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "13",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kiteechin bik si manamgei ak kanamonik",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo biit maotiondo, anan karuotitoindo, ak koborun kaborunet anan kwong’utiet, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak koyaak kaborunonoto anan kwong’utionoto ne kimwaun, kole, Ongisub kanamonik, che kima ingen, ak ongeot choto; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ko meepchi it ng’alekab maotiondonoto, anan karuotitoindonoto: amu tiemok Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, si konai ngochame Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ eng’ mugulelwekwok komugul ak eng’ sobonwekwok komugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obendate osub Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, oiywei inendet, ak orib ng’atutikyik, ak ogas it kutinnyi, oboisiechi ak onamge ak inendet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kibarei maotiondonoto anan karuotitoindonoto; amu kimwa kit ne ibeeti bik kobagakta Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’, ne kiimutwok omong’une emetab Misri, ne kiitiachin eng’ gotab otwognatet, kole komaasin eng’ oret ne king’atin Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’wong’ iwendote. Iste anyun ko u noto yaitiet eng’ kwenung’ung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngo kaigain eng’ ung’ot ng’etab komet, anan wering’ung’, anan cheptang’ung’, anan osotiondeng’ung’ ne ichame, anan chorueng’ung’ ne ichame ko u ye ichame sobondang’ung’, kolenjin, Ngebe keot kanamonik, che kima ingen, inye, anan kwanisieguk; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kanamonikab bororiosiek che mi tabanwekwok, che negitenen anan che looenen, koboch tabanda age ne bo ng’ony agoi tabanda age; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ameyanji, anan igasyi; ama, ye igeer, irire, anan ibagakte, anan iuny: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ago bar anyun inendet iman; ngo sib kobar inendet eung’ung’, ak ye ibata kobar bik tugul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lach eng’ koik kot kome; amu kicheng’ei komaasin imete Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ ne kiimutun imong’une emetab Misri, eng’ gotab otwognatet. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kogas Israelik tugul, ak koiyweis, si mata koyai sogornatet ne u nito kogeny eng’ kwenung’ung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngigas keng’alale age eng’ nganasoguk, ne konin Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’ imeny, kelen, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kamong’une kwenung’ung’ bik alak che yaach, ak koba komaas bik che menyei nganasenywa, kolenji, Ongebe keot cheptalelisiek, che mongen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "teeb anyun; ak icheng’, ak igin, igiiljige; ak keero, ngo imanit, ko u noto ng’olyondonoto, kele kogeyai kit ne kiwechei eng’ kwenung’ung’, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ibar anyun bikab nganasanato eng’ rotwetab chok, iwong’u, koboto tuguk tugul che mitei ak tuga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak iyumji tugukyik tugul kwenutab oretab nganasanato, ak ibeel nganaset, ak tugukyik tugul kogesgei, ibeelji Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’: ak koek tulwo koigeny; ma keteechei kogeny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amenam eng’ eung’ung’ kiy age tugul ne kigeisto: si koweek Jehovah kobagach neregekyik che koromen, ak korirenen, ak kochamin, ak kobarain, ko u ye kigoyosiechi kwanisieguk; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ye iepchi it kutitab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’, ak irib ng’atutikyik tugul che kang’atin rani, iyai noto bo iman eng’ taitab Jehovah Kamuktaindeng’ung’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
